{"id":"H6698","lemma":"צוּר","transliteration":"tsur","sayIt":"TSUR","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Zur","meaning":"A man living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, only mentioned at Num.25.15;\nfather of: Cozbi (H3579)\n§ Zur = \"rock\"\n1) father of Cozbi and one of the 5 Midianite princes who were slain when Balaam fell\n2) son of Jehiel, the father or leader of Gibeon","glosses":["zur","then zur","hur"],"count":5,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"num-25","v":15,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Zur","kjv":"of Zur"}},{"chapterId":"num-31","v":8,"renderings":{"bsb":"Hur","kjv":"and Zur"}},{"chapterId":"jos-13","v":21,"renderings":{"bsb":"Zur","kjv":"and Zur"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-8","v":30,"renderings":{"bsb":"then Zur","kjv":"and Zur"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-9","v":36,"renderings":{"bsb":"then Zur","kjv":"then Zur"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Numbers 25:15","note":"The name of the Midianite woman who was slain was Cozbi, the daughter of Zur. He was head of the people of a fathers’ house in Midian.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Joshua 13:21","note":"all the cities of the plain, and all the kingdom of Sihon king of the Amorites, who reigned in Heshbon, whom Moses struck with the chiefs of Midian, Evi…","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Chronicles 8:30","note":"with his firstborn son Abdon, Zur, Kish, Baal, Nadab,","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H5369","lemma":"נֵר","transliteration":"ner","gloss":"Ner"},{"id":"H0022","lemma":"אֲבִיאֵל","transliteration":"aviel","gloss":"Abiel"},{"id":"H0283","lemma":"אַחְיוֹ","transliteration":"achyo","gloss":"Ahio"},{"id":"H1168","lemma":"בַּעַל","transliteration":"baal","gloss":"Baal"},{"id":"H1446","lemma":"גְּדוֹר","transliteration":"gedor","gloss":"Gedor"},{"id":"H2144","lemma":"זֶ֫כֶר","transliteration":"zekher","gloss":"Zecher"},{"id":"H3579","lemma":"כָּזְבִי","transliteration":"kozevi","gloss":"Cozbi"},{"id":"H4601","lemma":"מַעֲכָה","transliteration":"maakhah","gloss":"Maacah"}],"senses":[{"id":"H6698H","gloss":"Zur","relation":"H6698H ="